     "description": "Add new text to a Note: a section, a paragraph, a list or a table you write from the Documents or this conversation, or the piece of writing the User asked for, into the empty Note in front. Cite it as an Answer: call cite first, then put its markers in content, in each table cell as in a paragraph. It applies in the Note at once, with Undo. To change text already there, your own included, use edit_mind: never add a longer version of it beside it."
